NVIDIA grouped weight-gradient kernel
--------------------------------------

nvfp4moe/cwgrad contains an adapted grouped block-scaled GEMM weight-gradient
implementation originating from NVIDIA cuDNN Frontend examples. The files
retain NVIDIA copyright and SPDX Apache-2.0 headers.

Upstream: https://github.com/NVIDIA/cudnn-frontend

